{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-209", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/209", "wordCount": 1886, "segments": [{"start": 18.0, "text": "Hello. Welcome everyone."}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "My name is Gaurav and today"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "we're going to talk about What's"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "New in Machine Learning."}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "Machine Learning is used by"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "thousands of apps."}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "The apps that you are making are"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "amazing."}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "They're touching every aspect of"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "a user's life."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "In hospitals, doctors are using"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "apps such as Butterfly iQ to do"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "medical diagnostics in real"}, {"start": 52.0, "text": "time. In sports, coaches are using"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "apps such as HomeCourt to train"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "their players."}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "In creativity, apps such as"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "Pixelmator Pro are helping other"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "users to augment their"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "creativity using ML."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "These are just a few examples,"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "and we would like all of these"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "apps you guys should also make"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "these kind of apps."}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "So now the question is what's"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "new?"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "Let me begin by saying a lot."}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "We have so much material that we"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "can hardly cover it one session"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "or two sessions."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "We need ten sessions to cover"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "the entire material."}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "We also have a session"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "intersecting the design in"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "machine learning."}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "We also have Daily Labs where"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "you can meet and discuss your"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "ideas with Apple Machine"}, {"start": 111.0, "text": "Learning engineers."}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "All of us are here to remove any"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "roadblocks that you might be"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "facing while integrating Machine"}, {"start": 119.0, "text": "Learning in your app."}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "In all of these sessions, you"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "will see that we follow simple"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "principles."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "We want Machine Learning to be"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "as easy to use as possible."}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "We are laser focused on doing"}, {"start": 135.0, "text": "that. We want to make it flexible so"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "you can do it by variety of"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "tasks, and we want to make it"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "powerful so you can run state of"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "the art Machine Learning models"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "on your devices."}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "It is truly Machine Learning for"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "everyone whether you are a"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "researcher or someone new to"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "Machine Learning."}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "With Create ML app you can"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "make state of the art,"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "task-focused ML models."}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "The next big pillar of our"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "offering is Domain APIs."}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "Domain APIs allow you to"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "leverage Apple's built-in"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "intelligence and models."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "So you don't have to worry about"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "collecting the data and building"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "the model."}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "Simply call the API and be done."}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "This year we are significantly"}, {"start": 184.0, "text": "expanding our Domain APIs."}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "We have Domain APIs in Vision,"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "Text, Speech and Sound."}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "Now let's take a sneak peek of"}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "some of these APIs."}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "Let's start with Vision."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "Vision allows you to reason"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "about the content of the image."}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "One of the new features this"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "year is Image Saliency."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "Image Saliency can help you"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "identify the most relevant"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "region in your image."}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "In this case, the region around"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "the person."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "You can use it to generate"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "thumbnails or to make image"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "cropping, generate memories,"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "guide camera et cetera."}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "Another big feature we are"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "introducing this year is Text"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "Recognition."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "You can now take a picture of"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "the document, perform"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "perspective correction, lighting"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "correction and reorganize the"}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "text on the device."}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "This is huge, but that's not"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "all. We have Image inbuilt"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "classifier, human detector, pet"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "detector, and we are going to"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "cover them in detail in our two"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "Vision sessions."}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "Next domain is Natural Language."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "Just like you use Vision to"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "reason about images you can use"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "Natural Language to reason about"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "the text."}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "New this year is inbuilt"}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "Sentiment Analysis."}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "So you can use to analyze the"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "sentiment of the text in real"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "time on the device in a privacy"}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "friendly way."}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "So, for example, if somebody"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "types something like this I was"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "so excited about the season"}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "finale that's a positive"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "sentiment, but it was a bit"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "disappointing at the end it's a"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "negative sentiment."}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "So you can provide this kind of"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "feedback in real time."}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "For the first time we are also"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "exposing inbuilt Word"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "Embeddings."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "Word Embeddings can allow you to"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "find semantically similar words."}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "So, for example, the word"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "thunderstorm is very close to"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "cloudy but it is very far away"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "from shoes and boots."}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "One of the big use case of Word"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "Embeddings is semantic search"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "and we are going to give you an"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "example soon."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "Natural Language will be"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "discussed in detail in Advances"}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "in Natural Language Framework"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "session."}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "The third way user interacts"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "with your app is through speech"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "and sound."}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "Now we have an on-device speech"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "support so you can transcribe"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "the text on the device so you no"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "longer have to rely on the"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "network connection, and we also"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "have new Voice Analytics API"}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "that can tell you not only what"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "is spoken but how it is spoken."}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "So you can differentiate between"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "a normal voice and a high"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "jittery voice."}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "We also have a brand-new Sound"}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "Analysis Framework, that we will"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "discuss in Create ML session."}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "There's a lot more in each of"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "these domains and another thing"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "you can do to combine these"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "domains almost seamlessly."}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "Let me show you an example."}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "Let's just say you want to build"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "a feature that does Semantic"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "Search on Images."}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "That's a very complex feature."}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "So if a user searches for"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "thunderstorm, you want to"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "provide them the results not"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "only for thunderstorm but also"}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "for sky and cloudy."}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "Now, you can combine Vision with"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "Natural Language to implement"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "this feature in very few lines"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "of code."}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "This is how you will do it."}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "You will run your Image"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "Classifier on images or you can"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "have them use inbuilt Image"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "Classifier to generate the tags."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "When the user types the word"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "something like thunderstorm, you"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "can use Word Embeddings to"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "generate similar words and find"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "the images that matches these"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "tags."}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "And that's not all."}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "You can also combine the custom"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "models that you made using"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "Create ML with Domain APIs, and"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "we are going to show an example"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "of that in our Creating Great"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "Apps Using Core ML and ARKit"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "session."}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "So to summarize, Domain APIs"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "allow you to leverage Apple's"}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "built-in intelligence and model"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "using API so you don't have to"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "collect the data and make the"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "models."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "And this year we have a"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "significant expansion in our"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "Vision Natural Language and"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "Speech and Sound APIs."}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "Now let's talk about Core ML 3,"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "the third big pillar of our"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "offering."}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "Core ML is now supported across"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "all our platforms."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "All the work is done on the"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "device so user's privacy is"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "maintained."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "Core ML is hardware accelerated"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "so you can do, you can use it"}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "for realtime Machine Learning"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "and you don't need a server and"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "it always available."}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "Core ML has always supported a"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "wide variety of Machine Learning"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "models ranging from classical"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "generalized linear models, tree"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "ensembles and support vector"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "machines as well as neural"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "networks such as Convolution"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "Neural Network and Recurrent"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "Neural Networks."}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "New in Core ML is model"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "flexibility and model"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "personalization."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "So let's take a look at both of"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "Core ML has expanded support for"}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "Data Neural Networks and we have"}, {"start": 541.0, "text": "added a support for more than"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "100+ Neural Network layers."}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "This means that you can bring"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "almost, you can bring the most"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "cutting-edge Machine Learning"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "models into your app such as"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "ELMo, BERT, Wavenet."}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "What does that mean?"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "Let's just say you have an app"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "and you want to integrate a"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "state of the art Question and"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "Answer system in your app so"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "that when a user asks a question"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "how many sessions will there be"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "at WWDC this year?"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "You can do it by using BERT"}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "model."}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "So the model can analyze the"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "statement and gives feedback the"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "result over 100 is the answer."}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "Besides Natural Language you can"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "also run the latest advances in"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "Vision such as Instance"}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "Segmentation as well as latest"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "advances in Audio Generation."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "And to take full advantage of"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "this expanded support of Core"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "ML, we are updating our"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "converters. So we will have a brand new"}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "TensorFlow Core ML converter and"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "ONNX support ML converter will"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "be coming soon."}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "We are also updating our Model"}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "Gallery importing some of these"}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "research models on our Model"}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "Gallery so you can start using"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "them immediately."}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "So Core ML 3 with this new model"}, {"start": 624.0, "text": "representation and embedded"}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "converters with Model Gallery"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "can help you bring the cutting"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "edge ML research into your app."}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "Now a big feature, Model"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "Personalization."}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "So let me explain what it is."}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "So up to now you have seen, you"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "have used Create ML to build the"}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "models and Core ML to deploy the"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "models, but new in Core ML 3 is"}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "On-Device Model Personalization."}, {"start": 650.0, "text": "You can fine tune the model on"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "the device."}, {"start": 653.0, "text": "And we use this kind of"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "technology in Face ID and"}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "setting Watch Face."}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "So this is how it happens."}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "Today you have data, you make an"}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "ML model, you ship it to your"}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "app and all of your users"}, {"start": 673.0, "text": "download the same model."}, {"start": 675.0, "text": "And this is great because now"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "users don't have to upload their"}, {"start": 681.0, "text": "photos."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "You can directly take photos,"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "run through the model on the"}, {"start": 685.0, "text": "device and get inference such as"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "dog. But what if you are trying to"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "deal with a concept that is"}, {"start": 695.0, "text": "unique to each user?"}, {"start": 697.0, "text": "Say the concept of My Dog."}, {"start": 699.0, "text": "You might want users to find"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "pictures of their own dog in the"}, {"start": 702.0, "text": "photo library and not all dog"}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "photos they've taken."}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "And each user's dog looks"}, {"start": 708.0, "text": "different."}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "For example, someone may have"}, {"start": 710.0, "text": "Golden Retriever, someone may"}, {"start": 712.0, "text": "have this Bulldog, ah, and this"}, {"start": 714.0, "text": "is my crazy dog."}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "So, how do we do that?"}, {"start": 722.0, "text": "So what we want is for user 1 we"}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "need image classifier that takes"}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "this dog and says it's their"}, {"start": 728.0, "text": "dog."}, {"start": 730.0, "text": "For user 2, that's the English"}, {"start": 732.0, "text": "Bulldog and this the third dog."}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "So in order to do that, one"}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "approach would be to use Server"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "Based Approach. So you may ask each of your"}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "users to upload the photos in"}, {"start": 751.0, "text": "the Cloud."}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "Server generates model for each"}, {"start": 754.0, "text": "of the users and then sends it"}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "back. Unfortunately, this approach has"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "privacy concerns."}, {"start": 762.0, "text": "Your user may not be very happy"}, {"start": 765.0, "text": "uploading their photo to your"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "server and you may also not be"}, {"start": 768.0, "text": "okay taking their photo."}, {"start": 770.0, "text": "You have to setup the server so"}, {"start": 771.0, "text": "there is some cost involved."}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "Let us say you have a million"}, {"start": 776.0, "text": "users, which we sincerely hope"}, {"start": 778.0, "text": "you do, you have to make"}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "millions such models and keep"}, {"start": 780.0, "text": "track of them over time."}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "With Core ML 3 you can do more"}, {"start": 787.0, "text": "personalization on the device."}, {"start": 789.0, "text": "So if you have a training data"}, {"start": 791.0, "text": "on the device, you can just"}, {"start": 793.0, "text": "simply use it to fine tune the"}, {"start": 795.0, "text": "model on the device."}, {"start": 797.0, "text": "So previously you take LMH and"}, {"start": 803.0, "text": "you do the inference and now you"}, {"start": 807.0, "text": "can take the label data feedback"}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "from the user, provide some kind"}, {"start": 810.0, "text": "of training data and fine tune"}, {"start": 812.0, "text": "the model on the device."}, {"start": 822.0, "text": "You have a personalized model"}, {"start": 824.0, "text": "for each user."}, {"start": 828.0, "text": "We respect user's privacy and"}, {"start": 830.0, "text": "you don't need to put server."}, {"start": 833.0, "text": "So Core ML 3 supports On-Device"}, {"start": 836.0, "text": "Personalization for Neural"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "Networks."}, {"start": 839.0, "text": "We're also supporting Nearest"}, {"start": 841.0, "text": "Neighbor and you can do it in"}, {"start": 843.0, "text": "the background at night."}, {"start": 848.0, "text": "So to summarize and end our"}, {"start": 850.0, "text": "session we saw Create ML a brand"}, {"start": 853.0, "text": "new app to build ML models, we"}, {"start": 856.0, "text": "have a significant expansion in"}, {"start": 857.0, "text": "our Domain APIs and Core ML is"}, {"start": 861.0, "text": "much more flexible and now"}, {"start": 862.0, "text": "supports On-Device"}, {"start": 863.0, "text": "Personalization."}, {"start": 865.0, "text": "You can find more information on"}, {"start": 869.0, "text": "our Developer Website Session"}, {"start": 870.0, "text": "209 and we hope you are as"}, {"start": 873.0, "text": "excited about these technologies"}, {"start": 875.0, "text": "as we are."}, {"start": 876.0, "text": "I look forward to seeing you in"}, {"start": 877.0, "text": "the labs."}]}
